// GZIP binary - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A real gzip member of "Hello World!", written by gzip.compress
# with mtime 0 so the bytes are reproducible.
0000  1F 8B 08 00 00 00 00 00 02 FF F3 48 CD C9 C9 57 |...........H...W|
0010  08 CF 2F CA 49 51 04 00 A3 1C 29 1C 0C 00 00 00 |../.IQ....).....|
